# Project estimate

Move the sliders. The table recalculates. Trust this document to turn the sliders on.

:slider hours = 20 min=1 max=200 step=1
:slider rate = 120 min=50 max=300 step=10
:state discount = 10

:computed subtotal = hours * rate
:computed saved = subtotal * discount / 100
:computed total = subtotal - saved

| Item | Amount |
| --- | --- |
| Hours | { hours } |
| Rate | { rate } |
| Subtotal | { subtotal } |
| Discount | { saved } |
| **Total** | **{ total }** |

Slider positions are temporary preview state. They are not saved into the file.
